[downloaded] The all-MiniLM-L6-v2 embedding model powers the optional Smart Search feature
  (natural-language search), which is OFF by default. The model is not shipped with NexusM; it is
  fetched from Hugging Face only when a user enables the feature. Model card:
  https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2

[downloaded] EmulatorJS (https://github.com/EmulatorJS/EmulatorJS) powers the optional retro Game
  Emulator feature (play ROMs in the browser), which is OFF by default. EmulatorJS is a SEPARATE
  project under the GPL-3.0 license, a different license to NexusM itself (PolyForm Noncommercial
  1.0.0, above).
  It is never bundled with NexusM, never modified, and never included in this installer/portable
  package - it is downloaded unmodified from its own official release, into its own folder, only
  when an admin opts in from Settings. Full license:
  https://github.com/EmulatorJS/EmulatorJS/blob/main/LICENSE

================================================================================
EXTERNAL DATA & CONTENT SOURCES
================================================================================

NexusM can optionally retrieve metadata and artwork from third-party online
services. This content is owned by its respective providers and is subject to
their terms; NexusM does not redistribute it and only fetches it on the user's
behalf when an API key is configured.

  Service          Content                       Attribution / Terms
  ───────────────  ────────────────────────────  ──────────────────────────────────────
  fanart.tv        Movie / TV posters, backdrops  Images licensed CC BY 3.0 — attribution
                                                  required. © fanart.tv contributors.
                                                  https://fanart.tv
  TMDB             Movie / TV metadata, images    This product uses the TMDB API but is
                                                  not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
                                                  https://www.themoviedb.org
  TVmaze           TV metadata                    Data under CC BY-SA 4.0 (licensing terms
                                                  per TVmaze API). https://www.tvmaze.com
  libretro-database Game ROM identification       Hash-indexed (CRC32) No-Intro game data -
                   (title, genre, developer,       title, genre, release date, etc. Data
                   publisher, release date)        under CC BY-SA 4.0. Downloaded on demand,
                                                  per platform, not bundled. Not shipped
                                                  with NexusM.
                                                  https://github.com/libretro/libretro-database
  libretro-        Game box art                   Box art images, each owned by its game's
  thumbnails                                      original publisher; redistributed by the
                                                  libretro-thumbnails project without a
                                                  separate stated license for the images
                                                  themselves. Fetched on demand, per game,
                                                  not bundled.
                                                  https://github.com/libretro-thumbnails

